UPDATE companies SET description='Old Capitol Food Company operates from Iowa City, Iowa, producing tofu from locally grown organic soybeans. The company''s founding year and ownership structure are not publicly disclosed.

The facility manufactures tofu using 100 percent non-GMO organic soybeans sourced directly from Iowa farms. Production serves both institutional and retail channels, though specific facility size, headcount, and output volumes are not published.

Customers include major Iowa institutions such as the University of Iowa, Grinnell College, and Cornell College, as well as the New Pioneer Food Co-op, Hy-Vee grocery stores, independent restaurants, and other food co-ops and dining halls across the region.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Tofu manufacturing", "Organic soybean sourcing", "Local ingredient procurement"], "industries": ["Institutional food service", "Grocery retail", "Food cooperatives", "Restaurant supply"], "materials": ["Non-GMO organic soybeans (Iowa-grown)"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["100% non-GMO organic Iowa-grown soybeans", "Direct relationships with local soybean growers", "Focus on environmental sustainability", "Supplying Iowa institutions and retailers"], "facts_used": ["Location: Iowa City, Iowa -> db", "Product: Tofu from 100% non-GMO organic Iowa-grown soybeans -> /", "Customers: University of Iowa, Grinnell College, Cornell College, New Pioneer Food Co-op, Hy-Vee, restaurants -> /", "Values: Local vendor connections, environmental sustainability -> /", "Company type: Manufacturer (produces tofu) -> /"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Using 100% non-gmo organic Iowa-grown soybeans", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='old-capitol-food-company' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Oliveira Textiles was founded in 2007 in Bristol, Rhode Island, by textile designer Dawn Oliveira. After more than two decades in the textile industry, Oliveira launched the company to create more healthful surroundings through thoughtfully produced goods.

The studio produces the Ocean Collection, a line of contemporary coastal patterns printed on hemp and organic cotton. Operations include textile printing, pattern design, and custom color development. Products are sold as fabric by the yard and as finished pillows, with stock fabrics and custom options available directly from the Bristol studio.

The company serves the home textiles and interior design markets, targeting consumers and designers seeking coastal-inspired decor. Oliveira Textiles also pursues freelance collaborations and licensing opportunities, and ships swatches worldwide.

Oliveira started the business after research showed consumers want to use their purchasing power to support thoughtfully produced goods, positioning the brand around healthful, sustainable materials and coastal aesthetics.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Textile printing on hemp and organic cotton", "Pattern design", "Custom color development", "Fabric sales by the yard", "Finished pillow production"], "industries": ["Home textiles", "Interior design", "Coastal home decor"], "materials": ["Hemp", "Organic cotton"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Contemporary coastal patterns printed on hemp and organic cotton", "Custom color options on stock fabrics", "Freelance collaborations and licensing opportunities", "Swatches shipped worldwide"], "facts_used": ["Founded 2007 by Dawn Oliveira -> /", "Headquarters Bristol, Rhode Island -> /", "Products: Ocean Collection printed on hemp and organic cotton -> /", "Sells fabric by the yard and finished pillows -> /", "Offers custom color options and licensing collaborations -> /", "Ships swatches worldwide -> /"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "I founded Oliveira Textiles in 2007 and introduced ''The Ocean Collection'': contemporary coastal patterns printed on hemp and organic cotton. ... I sell fabric by the yard and finished pillows.", "founded_year": "2007", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='oliveira-textiles' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Olson Sheet Metal Works Inc has operated in Minneapolis, Minnesota since 1928, when Clifford E. Olson founded the business. The company remains family-owned and is now led by the third generation, Robert Dale Olson, following his father Robert C. Olson.

The shop provides complete layout and fabrication of custom metalwork, handling shearing (up to 10-foot capacity), bending with hand brakes and a 10-foot 300-ton press brake, sheet rolling, tube and angle rolling, and a range of welding processes including spot, stick, MIG, and TIG. Plasma and torch cutting, as well as polishing, round out the in-house capabilities.

Projects span architectural metalwork such as railings, staircases, hoods, copper roofs, and planter boxes, as well as custom furniture, display fixtures, sinks, counters, and hardware.

