UPDATE companies SET description='PDI Duct operates from North Chelmsford, Massachusetts, where it has fabricated PVC and CPVC duct systems since 1976. The business began as Plastic Design Inc. and later became a division of Plastic Design Industries, a company that also encompasses Chemical Systems Services, Inc. No founders are named in the source material.

