UPDATE companies SET description='Pak-Rite, Ltd. Michigan was established in 1946 in Wixom, Michigan, a suburb northwest of Detroit. The company operates as a third-generation, family-owned business that has evolved into a full-service packaging design and manufacturing firm serving the Midwest and beyond.

The company designs and manufactures custom packaging solutions ranging from basic shipping containers to complex foam and plastic inserts produced via CNC cutting. Its capabilities include engineered wood packaging, foam components, plastic components, and custom crating, all supported by in-house CAD design, 3D modeling, and laser scanning. Pak-Rite emphasizes no tooling or set-up charges and handles prototype through production volumes with high-tolerance precision.

Pak-Rite serves the aerospace industry, as indicated by its dedicated industry page, and provides custom packaging for diverse applications such as communications equipment cases, military-grade foam inserts for companies like B&W North America, and specialized firearm cases for hunting travel.

The company states its differentiation lies in personalized service, attention to detail, on-time delivery, and consistent customer satisfaction. It prioritizes U.S.-based suppliers and proudly manufactures all products in the USA, while investing in state-of-the-art technology to deliver economical, environmentally friendly, high-quality packaging.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom packaging design", "CNC cutting", "CAD design", "3D modeling", "Laser scanning", "Engineered wood packaging", "Foam fabrication", "Plastic fabrication", "Custom foam inserts", "Custom crating", "Pelican case customization", "Sure-Lok crate manufacturing"], "industries": ["Aerospace"], "materials": ["Foam", "Plastic", "Engineered wood", "Excelotrast foam"], "equipment": [], "volume": "Prototype to production volumes; high or low volume", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["No tooling or set-up charges", "Prototype to production volumes with high-tolerance precision", "In-house CAD design, 3D modeling, and laser scanning", "Made in the USA with U.S.-based suppliers", "Personalized service and on-time delivery"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1946 -> /about-us", "Third-generation family-owned -> /about-us", "Headquartered in Wixom, Michigan -> /about-us", "Full-service packaging design and manufacturing -> /about-us", "Capabilities: CNC cutting, CAD design, laser scanning, no tooling charges, prototype to production -> /about-us", "Industries served: Aerospace -> /", "Products: Sure-Lok Crates, Pelican Products, Engineered Wood Packaging, Foam Components, Plastic Components -> /", "Testimonials reference B&W North America, communications equipment, hunting cases -> /", "Made in USA, US-based suppliers -> /about-us", "Personalized service, on-time delivery -> /about-us"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Pak-Rite, Ltd. Michigan was established in 1946 and has grown into a full-service packaging design and man