UPDATE companies SET description='PakTech is headquartered in Eugene, Oregon. The family-owned company was founded in 1991, originally operating as a job shop producing molds for injection-molding firms before pivoting to manufacturing its own injection-molded handles from recycled HDPE for the beverage industry.

Today PakTech designs and manufactures 100% recyclable multi-pack handles and automated in-line application equipment. The handles are injection molded from 100% post-consumer recycled HDPE, sourced from materials such as milk jugs. The company also supplies the applicators that integrate into packaging lines for high-speed multi-packing.

PakTech serves the food, beverage, and consumer goods sectors, including household products. Its handles are used to multi-pack soft drinks, beer, wine, cider, kombucha, craft cocktails, coffee, juice, water, cleaning supplies, and health and beauty items. Customers range from established corporations to start-up manufacturers.

The company was built on a commitment to environmentally friendly manufacturing, using 100% recycled and recyclable HDPE to reduce waste and greenhouse gas emissions. Its mission emphasizes smart, low-waste packaging handles, turnkey automated equipment, superior product quality, customer service, and long-term partnerships. PakTech''s recycled content is certified by SCS Global Services, and it has established recycling partnerships with over 500 businesses to keep handles in a circular loop.', certifications=ARRAY['SCS Global Services Recycled Content Certification']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Injection molding of recycled HDPE", "Automated in-line applicator integration", "Multi-pack handle design", "Custom handle manufacturing", "Recycled HDPE material processing", "Packaging line integration"], "industries": ["Food and beverage", "Consumer goods", "Household products", "Packaging", "Craft beverage", "Cleaning supplies", "Health and beauty"], "materials": ["Recycled HDPE", "HDPE (high-density polyethylene)"], "equipment": ["Automated in-line applicators", "Injection molding machines"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["100% recycled and recyclable HDPE handles", "Automated in-line application equipment for turnkey packaging", "Recycled content certified by SCS Global Services", "Family-owned and operated since 1991", "Over 500 recycling partner locations for circular handle recovery"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 1991 -> /about", "Family-owned -> /about", "Headquartered in Eugene, Oregon -> /about, db", "Manufacturer of injection molded handles from 100% recycled HDPE -> /about", "Automated in-line application equipment -> /about", "Serves food, beverage, consumer goods industries -> /about", "Products multi-packed: soft drinks, beer, wine, cider, kombucha, craft cocktails, coffee, juice, water, cleaning supplies, health and beauty products -> /about", "Recycled content certified by SCS Global Services -> /", "Partnered with