UPDATE companies SET description='Palmetto Welding & Fabrication Services, LLC was founded in February 2019 by Amanda Koch and Michael Meyer in Summerville, South Carolina. The couple met in 2017 while Michael was working as a contract welder in Wyoming, and they relocated with their families to the Charleston area in 2018. Amanda brought 20 years of office management experience, primarily in oil and gas, while Michael had spent his career in welding across industries such as oil and gas, marine, nuclear, automotive, and structural steel.

The company provides structural steel fabrication and erection, miscellaneous steel fabrication and installation, and aluminum fabrication and erection. Its shop includes a plasma burn table capable of cutting plate up to 1 inch thick. In January 2020 the firm acquired a 9,500‑square‑foot facility on two acres and employed 17 skilled workers, with plans to expand into a 30,000‑square‑foot building in early 2022.

The business was started after Michael identified a local need for skilled, affordable welding services for both production and mobile work. The company says it differentiates itself through AISC certification in both fabrication and erection, which allows it to bid on projects with stringent quality‑control requirements, and through a commitment to adapting its operations to client needs.', certifications=ARRAY['AISC Certified (Fabrication and Erection)']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Structural steel fabrication", "Structural steel erection", "Miscellaneous steel fabrication", "Miscellaneous steel erection/installation", "Aluminum fabrication", "Aluminum installation/erection", "Plasma burning (up to 1\" thick)", "Ladder fabrication", "Handrail/guardrail fabrication", "Stair fabrication", "RTU frame fabrication", "Bollard fabrication", "Embed fabrication", "Shelf angle fabrication", "Lintel fabrication", "Canopy/awning fabrication", "Platform fabrication", "Cupola fabrication", "Welding (SMAW, GMAW, FCAW, GTAW)", "Metal repair"], "industries": [], "materials": ["Aluminum", "Stainless steel", "Carbon steel"], "equipment": ["Plasma burn table (up to 1\" thick)"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["AISC certified in fabrication and erection", "Plasma burn table cutting up to 1\" thick plate", "Certified welders qualified in SMAW, GMAW, FCAW, GTAW all positions", "Licensed, insured, and able to service the entire region", "Mobile welding origins with current fixed facility"], "facts_used": ["Founded February 2019 by Amanda Koch and Michael Meyer -> /about", "Headquarters in Summerville, South Carolina -> /about", "Amanda Koch background in office management, oil and gas -> /about", "Michael Meyer welding career across oil and gas, marine, nuclear, automotive, structural -> /about", "Michael certified in SMAW, GMAW, FCAW, GTAW, 1G-6G -> /about", "Company handles structural and miscellaneous metal fabrication and repair in aluminum, stainless steel, carbon steel -> /about", "Licensed and insured, services entire region -> /about", "Acquired 9,500 sq ft facility on 2 acres in January 2020 -> /about", "Employ 17 skilled workers as of 2020 -> /about", "Planned expansion to 30,000 sq ft in Q1 2022 -> /about", "AISC certified in fabrication and erection -> /about", "Services: structural steel fabrication, erection, miscellaneous steel fabrication, erection, aluminum fabrication, installation -> /services", "Plasma burn table up to 1\" thick -> /services", "Specific products: ladders, handrail/guardrail, stairs, RTU frames, bollards, embeds, shelf angles, lintels, canopies/awnings, platforms, cupolas -> /services", "Testimonial: pin and weld service -> /", "Testimonial: automotive trailing arm reinforcement -> /", "Testimonial: mobile welding, customer service -> /"], "company_type": "Contract manufacturer / job shop", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Our business model has morphed from a mobile welding company into a full blown miscellaneous and structural steel fabrication and erection company.", "founded_year": "2019", "employee_count": "17", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='palmetto-welding-fabrication-services-llc' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Having grown up helping his father with hands-on projects around the house, Rick initially built pieces for his own home before expanding to create custom furniture for others.

The shop produces custom furniture, cabinetry, and built-in pieces, handling both fabrication and installation. Projects range from stair gates and cabinet doors to bathroom vanities, dog crates, bunk beds, shelving, and commercial salon stations. Work is performed on a made-to-order basis, with no standardized product line or volume metrics disclosed.

