UPDATE companies SET description='Pennsylvania Farm Table Company operates from Exton, Pennsylvania, in a restored 1750 landmark building that once housed the West Whiteland Inn. The business was founded in 2013 by Bobby Snyder, a third‑generation woodworker who learned the craft from his grandfather, a dulcimer and banjo maker, and his father. After working in several other fields, Snyder returned to woodworking with the goal of building farm tables that would become family heirlooms.

The company produces custom farmhouse dining tables using traditional woodworking methods and locally sourced, sustainable Pennsylvania hardwoods. A signature feature is hand‑turned legs, shaped on lathes in their workshop. In response to growing demand, Snyder and his team recently built a larger production facility. The Exton showroom displays pre‑made tables and estate chairs, allowing customers to experience the pieces in a historic colonial setting.

Testimonials highlight families commissioning tables up to nine feet long for multi‑generational use.

Snyder has stated that the company was started to fill a personal calling: creating "modern heirlooms" that combine quality craftsmanship with wood from the region. The work has been featured in national magazines, recognized by HGTV’s Clint Harp, and earned multiple awards for craftsmanship and creativity.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom farmhouse table manufacturing", "Hand\u2011turned leg production", "Traditional joinery and woodworking", "Custom sizing and design consultation", "Wood finishing and hand\u2011rubbed finishes", "On\u2011site showroom display and selection"], "industries": ["Residential furniture", "Custom woodworking", "Home furnishings", "Interior design"], "materials": ["Locally sourced Pennsylvania hardwoods"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Hand\u2011turned legs on every table", "Locally sourced, sustainable Pennsylvania hardwoods", "Traditional woodworking techniques passed down three generations", "Custom\u2011built workshop expanded for increased capacity", "Showroom housed in a restored 1750 historic inn"], "facts_used": ["Founded 2013 by Bobby Snyder -> /about", "Third\u2011generation woodworker family history -> /about", "Located in Exton, PA, showroom in former West Whiteland Inn (built 1750) -> /", "Specializes in hand\u2011turned legs and traditional woodworking -> /", "Uses locally sourced sustainable Pennsylvania wood -> /", "Custom\u2011built larger workshop facility -> /about", "Featured in magazines, recognized by HGTV''s Clint Harp, won awards -> /about", "Primary customers are homeowners seeking custom dining tables -> /", "Showroom displays pre\u2011made tables and estate chairs -> /"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Bobby Snyder founded Pennsylvania Farm Table Company 2013 with the vision of creating high quality farm tables that will last a lifetime.", "founded_year": "2013", "employee_count": "",