UPDATE companies SET description='Pentar Incorporated was founded in 1998 in Huntsville, Alabama.

Pentar provides full turnkey contract manufacturing of electronic devices, handling in-house surface-mount and through-hole assembly, box-build and mechanical assembly, test, packaging, and worldwide drop-shipping. It also manages off-shore production with full project oversight. A service-and-repair depot supports field returns. The firm works from prototype quantities through high-volume runs, though facility size and headcount are not published.

The company serves telecommunications, consumer, industrial, and medical markets. A noted case study describes its work for Frederick Energy Products (FEP) on the HIT-NOT® pedestrian collision avoidance system. Pentar also produces devices for the Recon Outdoors line of hunting and outdoor-sportsman products.

