UPDATE companies SET description='Pharmco Industries Inc operates from its headquarters in Chamberlain, South Dakota, with additional locations in Platte, Winner, and Kimball. The company describes itself as locally owned and operated, though a founding year and founder names are not disclosed in public materials.

The business functions as a full-service agricultural supplier, offering feed, seed, animal health products, and farming and ranching equipment. Its service portfolio includes ration formulation, nutrition advice, management recommendations, alternative feed sourcing, byproduct comparison and supplement guidance, feedlot profitability analysis, cattle record-keeping with monthly tracking and closeout billing, regular visual cattle inspections, and brokered connections for feedstuffs and livestock.

Pharmco serves crop and livestock producers across the Midwest, including custom feed yards, feedlot operators, and row-crop farmers. Its customer base spans the livestock, seed, and broader agricultural sectors, with the team drawing on experience in livestock and seed industries to provide tailored recommendations.

