UPDATE companies SET description='Phoenix-Lamar Corporation, founded in 1972 by Maitland Huffman in Austin, Texas, operates as a family-owned contract manufacturer of custom cable assemblies and wire harnesses. Huffman, an electronics enthusiast with multiple degrees, established the company as a family enterprise, a culture that persists with long-tenured employees and repeat customers.

