UPDATE companies SET description='Piston Automotive operates in Louisville, Kentucky, as a brand of Piston Group, a private investment platform founded in 1996 by former NBA player Vinnie Johnson. The group began with a $1 million investment and has grown into a minority-owned enterprise encompassing Piston Automotive, Piston Interiors, and Detroit Thermal Systems. Johnson serves as chairman and CEO, while Jana Rosenmann leads Piston Automotive as president.

