UPDATE companies SET description='Pivotal Brewing Company operates from a historic mill building in Bristol, Rhode Island. The brewery and taproom opened with a focus on quality and experimentation, though the exact founding year and ownership structure are not publicly disclosed.

The company brews a diverse lineup of craft beers ranging from crisp modern lagers and hop-forward hazy IPAs to seasonal releases and small-batch experiments. The venue accommodates semi-private gatherings of 20 to 120 guests and full buyouts for up to 450 people.

The taproom serves walk-in customers seeking craft beer, live music, trivia nights, and family-friendly events such as storytime sessions. The event side hosts weddings, corporate functions, birthday parties, and welcome receptions.

