UPDATE companies SET description='Plastech Inc. operates from Corvallis, Oregon, where it has been based since 1976. The business traces its roots to 1970, when Al Hendrickson founded an injection molding operation in Rancho Cordova, California. In 1996, Al’s son Michael Hendrickson purchased the business, incorporated it, and changed the name to Plastech Inc. The firm remains family-owned and is currently led by Michael Hendrickson, with his daughter and son-in-law serving as key employees.

The company provides custom plastic injection molding along with a full suite of turnkey services: tool and die making (both domestic and offshore), CNC machining, rapid prototyping including 3D printing and fabrication, secondary operations, electro-mechanical assembly, and packaging. Production runs on seven injection molding machines ranging from 85 to 400 tons within a 12,500-square-foot manufacturing facility supported by 6,700 square feet of warehouse space. Plastech employs 14 family members, though total headcount is not disclosed.

Plastech serves a diverse customer base across industries including electronics, dental, sporting goods, pool and spa, consumer products, trucking, industrial, education, medical, and aerospace. The company works with clients both domestically and internationally, managing tooling partnerships with three offshore factories that have been in place for over 20 years.

Plastech emphasizes a customer-focused partnership model, aiming to be more than a manufacturer by offering design-for-manufacturing support and long-term service relationships. The company’s mission centers on delivering quality products at competitive prices through collaborative team environments.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Plastic Injection Molding", "CNC Machining", "Rapid Prototyping", "3D Printing", "Tool & Die Making", "Secondary Operations", "Electro-Mechanical Assembly", "Packaging", "Design for Manufacturing (DFM)", "Domestic Tooling", "Offshore Tooling", "Fabrication"], "industries": ["Electronics", "Dental", "Sporting Goods", "Pool & Spa", "Consumer Products", "Trucking", "Industrial", "Education", "Medical", "Aerospace"], "materials": [], "equipment": ["Injection molding machines (85\u2013400 ton)"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Family-owned and operated for over 45 years", "Seven injection molding machines (85\u2013400 ton capacity)", "Domestic and offshore tooling services with 20+ year strategic partnerships", "Turnkey manufacturing from design through packaging", "12,500 sq ft manufacturing + 6,700 sq ft warehouse in Corvallis, OR"], "facts_used": ["Plastech Inc. is a Custom Plastic Injection Molding company -> db", "Headquarters in Corvallis, Oregon -> db", "Founded 1970 by Al Hendrickson -> /about-us", "Family-owned for more than 45 years -> / and /about-us", "1996 Michael Hendrickson purchases and renames to Plastech Inc. -> / and /about-us", "Facility: 12,500 sqft manufacturing, 6,700 sqft warehouse -> /", "Seven molding machines ranging from 85 to 400 tons -> /", "Services: injection molding, tool & die, secondary operations, CNC machining & prototyping, 3D printing, rapid prototyping, assembly, packaging -> /services and /about-us", "Industries served: Electronics, Dental, Sporting Goods, Pool & Spa, Consumer Products, Trucking, Industrial, Education, Medical, Aerospace -> /