UPDATE companies SET description='The company began as a provider of printed circuit board assembly and has since expanded into a full-service partner for design, engineering, supply chain management, and distribution.

Today, Poly Electronics delivers integrated PCB solutions encompassing surface-mount (SMT), through-hole (THT), and hybrid assembly, along with box build, potting, and testing services that include flying probe and 3D automated optical inspection. The firm offers design-for-manufacturability consulting, component sourcing through a vetted global network, and warehousing with global distribution. Over its history, the company has engineered more than 3,500 custom electrical products.

Poly Electronics serves customers in sectors such as aviation, automotive, and industrial equipment, citing long-term relationships with companies including Vanair, Cargo Van & More, and Montego Dev. Many clients have remained with the company for 20 years or more, relying on its ability to manage component obsolescence and raw-material price fluctuations.

The company emphasizes a collaborative model, positioning itself as an extension of the customer’s team with quote turnaround of 48–72 hours for production-ready projects and solution delivery in as little as four weeks. Its quality system is certified to ISO 9001:2015, and it reports a 99.97% functionality rate on delivered items. Investment in equipment such as KOHYOUNG 3D AOI and flying probe testers supports its focus on consistent, on-time delivery.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 9001:2015']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Surface Mount Technology (SMT) assembly", "Through Hole Technology (THT) assembly", "Hybrid PCBA (mixed SMT/THT)", "Box build assembly", "Potting and encapsulation", "Flying probe testing", "3D Automated Optical Inspection (AOI)", "Design for Manufacturability (DFM) consulting", "PCB design and engineering", "Component sourcing and procurement", "Supply chain management", "Warehousing and global distribution", "ISO 9001:2015 quality management", "Component obsolescence monitoring", "Cost-saving design consultation"], "industries": ["Aviation", "Automotive", "Industrial equipment"], "materials": [], "equipment": ["Flying probe testing equipment", "KOHYOUNG 3D AOI in-line verification equipment", "SMT assembly equipment", "THT assembly equipment"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "As little as 4 weeks for solutions; 48\u201372 hours for production quotes", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["48\u201372 hour quote turnaround for production-ready projects", "Solution delivery in as little as 4 weeks", "99.97% functionality rate on delivered items", "ISO 9001:2015 certified quality management system", "Vetted global partner network for supply chain security"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 1973 -> db", "Headquarters Elkhart, Indiana -> db", "ISO 9001:2015 certified -> /quality", "SMT, THT, Hybrid PCBA capabilities -> /", "Box build and potting services -> /", "Flying probe testing and 3D AOI equipment -> /quality", "Engineered over 3,500 custom electrical p