UPDATE companies SET description='Precision Food Equipment LLC operates from Gilbert, Arizona, where it was founded on April 5, 2008 by Jason Hertel. The company began as a family-owned venture built on the principle that honest, reasonably priced service helps restaurants and delis succeed. Hertel started the business after observing that many foodservice operators were overpaying for mediocre repairs that often failed to resolve the underlying problem.

The firm specializes in repair and preventive maintenance for commercial food preparation and cooking equipment. Technicians service all makes and models of slicers, mixers, meat choppers, grinders, bread and bagel slicers, vegetable choppers, warmers, and Amana commercial microwaves. Work is performed both on-site via mobile service and in the company''s shop. Precision Food Equipment is also the authorized Arizona service location for the EZPRO 120 ventless deep fryer.

Named accounts include Arby''s, Wildflower Bread Company, Claim Jumper, and YC''s Mongolian Grill, all served across Arizona. Preventive maintenance plans are customized to each operation, focusing on safety, food waste reduction, production quality, and minimizing unplanned downtime.

